    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aetherfall</strong> is a stylized third-person action RPG extraction shooter set in an elemental apocalypse where the remnants of humanity fight for survival. Awaken from stasis and step into a world mutated by primal elemental forces, where every expedition is a high-stakes gamble. Master martial-arts inspired elemental combat, outwit rival factions and mutated beasts, uncover hidden secrets, and secure powerful loot\u2014but beware: dying in the field means losing everything you carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial Arts &amp; Elemental Combat </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful combos by blending martial arts with elemental magic. Mix elements to create devastating effects and shape the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/15b3ca79a527451e19d8edb63ed64018.poster.avif?t=1750088618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/15b3ca79a527451e19d8edb63ed64018.webm?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/15b3ca79a527451e19d8edb63ed64018.mp4?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression &amp; Customization</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle with a fully customizable character build. Focus on a tanky Earth build, a fast-moving Fire build that burns enemies down while kiting, or anything in between. With 9 unique elements to mix and match, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/58592ea8f8d5c42b27542012632f060e.poster.avif?t=1750088618\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/58592ea8f8d5c42b27542012632f060e.webm?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/58592ea8f8d5c42b27542012632f060e.mp4?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Fields System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the battlefield with elemental fields born from your attacks. Interact with them in real-time to unleash combos, dashes, and massive explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/3698ec9146cdf1ee6acbfa6379eb4644.poster.avif?t=1750088618\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/3698ec9146cdf1ee6acbfa6379eb4644.webm?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/3698ec9146cdf1ee6acbfa6379eb4644.mp4?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures of the old world have been warped by the Aetherfall\u2014ordinary animals twisted into fierce elemental predators. Each elemental mutation has unique strengths, requiring strategic adaptation and cunning to defeat. Local survivors have coined names for these formidable foes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blazeclaws</strong> \u2013 Bears fueled by volcanic rage, leaving fiery destruction in their wake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dustwraiths</strong> \u2013 Snake ambush predators lurking beneath the sand, striking from sudden, blinding whirlwinds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tideboars</strong> \u2013 Ferocious boars empowered by the seas, crashing through foes on waves summoned at will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earthweavers</strong> \u2013 Giant spiders of rock and soil, laying stone webs and springing from beneath the ground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive encounters with these and countless other warped beasts, mastering elemental strategies to overcome their deadly abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/715f403ffb354de53106e83d114b5fb9.poster.avif?t=1750088618\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/715f403ffb354de53106e83d114b5fb9.webm?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/715f403ffb354de53106e83d114b5fb9.mp4?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Ruined World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a shattered world shaped by elemental chaos. Use your powers to solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden paths, unlock ambush routes, and create escape shortcuts. Every corner of the world holds secrets for those willing to look\u2014and fight\u2014for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic PvPvE Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Aetherfall</i>, danger comes from all sides\u2014enemy players, mutated beasts, and the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalk weakened rivals after a tough boss fight, clash head-on in fair duels, or play it safe on the outskirts. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With match lengths ranging from quick 15-minute runs to hour-long marathons, every expedition is shaped by your strategy, risk appetite, and survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/ac4f43e7c0fcb71a2a6c1f194c63f7f2.poster.avif?t=1750088618\" width=800 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/ac4f43e7c0fcb71a2a6c1f194c63f7f2.webm?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/ac4f43e7c0fcb71a2a6c1f194c63f7f2.mp4?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Aetherfall sounds interesting and you want to stay up to date on news, please add to your wishlist !</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aetherfall</strong> is a stylized third-person action RPG extraction shooter set in an elemental apocalypse where the remnants of humanity fight for survival. Awaken from stasis and step into a world mutated by primal elemental forces, where every expedition is a high-stakes gamble. Master martial-arts inspired elemental combat, outwit rival factions and mutated beasts, uncover hidden secrets, and secure powerful loot\u2014but beware: dying in the field means losing everything you carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martial Arts &amp; Elemental Combat </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash powerful combos by blending martial arts with elemental magic. Mix elements to create devastating effects and shape the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/15b3ca79a527451e19d8edb63ed64018.poster.avif?t=1750088618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/15b3ca79a527451e19d8edb63ed64018.webm?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678790/extras/15b3ca79a527451e19d8edb63ed64018.mp4?t=1750088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression &amp; Customization</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your playstyle with a fully customizable character build. Focus on a tanky Earth build, a fast-moving Fire build that burns enemies down while kiting, or anything in between. With 9 unique elements to mix and match, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin